"No AI usage recorded yet. Once an editor runs a translation, generates a "
"meta description, or uses any other AI feature, totals will appear here."
msgstr ""
"Hakuna matumizi ya AI yaliyorekodiwa bado. Mara editor anapofanya tafsiri, "
"kuunda maelezo ya meta, au kutumia kipengele kingine cha AI, jumla "
"zitajitokeza hapa."

