#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:549
msgid "API Keys"
msgstr "Vifunguo vya API"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:41
msgid ""
"Keys are encrypted with AES-256-CBC before being stored in the WordPress "
"database. The encryption secret is derived from your WordPress auth salts "
"(wp-config.php), so plaintext keys never touch the database."
msgstr ""
"Vifunguo vinahifadhiwa kwa usalama kwa AES-256-CBC kabla havijasomwa kwenye "
"hifadhidata ya WordPress. Siri ya usimbuaji inatokana na chumvi za "
"uthibitishaji wa WordPress (wp-config.php), kwa hivyo funguo za maandishi "
"hayagusi hifadhidata kamwe."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:61
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "Funguo la API"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:74
msgid "Paste your API key…"
msgstr "Bandika funguo lako la API…"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:82
msgid "✓ Configured"
msgstr "Imesasishwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:87
msgid "✗ Not configured"
msgstr "Hijasasishwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:97
msgid "Test connection"
msgstr "Jaribu muunganisho"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:108
msgid "Leave blank to keep the existing key. Enter a new value to replace it."
msgstr ""
"Acha tupu ili kuhifadhi funguo iliyopo. Ingiza thamani mpya kuibadilisha."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:123
msgid "Remove stored key"
msgstr "Ondoa funguo iliyohifadhiwa"

#. translators: %s is the key source: either "environment variable" or "PHP constant".
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:131
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This key is currently supplied by a server %s and cannot be removed here. "
"Enter a new key above to override it with a database value."
msgstr ""
"Funguo hili kwa sasa linatolewa na seva %s na haliwezi kuondolewa hapa. "
"Ingiza funguo mpya juu ili kuilinda na thamani ya hifadhidata."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:136
msgid "environment variable"
msgstr "mabadiliko ya mazingira"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:137
msgid "PHP constant"
msgstr "kifungo cha PHP"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:153
msgid "Alternative (server-side):"
msgstr "Mbali (upande wa seva):"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:155
msgid ""
"You can also define keys as constants or environment variables (e.g. in wp-"
"config.php). Those sources are used automatically as a fallback when no "
"database key is stored."
msgstr ""
"Pia unaweza kufafanua funguo kama mabadiliko ya mazingira au mabadiliko ya "
"PHP (mfano katika wp-config.php). Vyanzo hivyo vinatumika kiotomatiki kama "
"mbadala wakati hakuna funguo ya hifadhidata iliyohifadhiwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:162
msgid ""
"To use a custom encryption secret (instead of the derived wp_salt value), "
"add this to wp-config.php:"
msgstr ""
"Ili kutumia siri ya usimbuaji wa desturi (badala ya thamani ya wp_salt "
"iliyotolewa), ongeza hii katika wp-config.php:"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:209
msgid "Unknown provider."
msgstr "Mtoa huduma haijulikani."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:217
msgid "No API key configured for this provider."
msgstr "Hakuna funguo ya API iliyowekwa kwa mtoa huduma huu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:248
msgid "Could not instantiate the provider."
msgstr "Haiwezi kuanzisha mtoa huduma."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/ApiKeysTab.php:263
msgid ""
"Provider returned no text. Check the WordPress error log for the detailed "
"failure reason."
msgstr ""
"Mtoa huduma haukutoa maandishi. Angalia kumbukumbu za makosa za WordPress "
"kwa sababu kamili ya kushindwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:20
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:551
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Tabia"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:29
msgid "Block Editor"
msgstr "Mhariri wa Block"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:33
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge restricts two Gutenberg features by default to keep editorial "
"behavior consistent across languages. Opt in here when you need full "
"Gutenberg / FSE capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge inazuia vipengele viwili vya Gutenberg kwa chaguo-msingi ili "
"kuweka tabia ya uhariri kuwa thabiti kati ya lugha. Chagua hapa ikiwa "
"unahitaji uwezo kamili wa Gutenberg / FSE."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:40
msgid "Block locking"
msgstr "Kufunga kwa block"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:50
msgid "Allow editors to lock individual blocks"
msgstr "Ruhusu wahariri kufunga blocks binafsi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:53
msgid ""
"Re-enables Gutenberg's canLockBlocks. Useful for editorial templates that "
"need to prevent contributors from moving or deleting specific blocks."
msgstr ""
"Inarudisha tena Gutenberg's canLockBlocks. Inafaa kwa templates za uhariri "
"zinazohitaji kuzuia wachangiaji kuhamisha au kufuta blocks fulani."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:59
msgid "Template mode"
msgstr "Hali ya template"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:69
msgid "Allow Gutenberg template-editing mode on post screens"
msgstr ""
"Ruhusu hali ya uhariri wa template wa Gutenberg kwenye skrini za chapisho"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:72
msgid ""
"Re-enables supportsTemplateMode. Core to Full-Site-Editing workflows where "
"post-level template overrides are intentional."
msgstr ""
"Inarudisha tena supportsTemplateMode. Muhimili kwa mchakato wa Uhariri wa "
"Tovuti Kamili ambapo ubadilishaji wa template wa kiwango cha chapisho ni nia."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:79
msgid "Compliance Preset"
msgstr "Preset ya Uzingatiaji"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:83
msgid ""
"Strict-preservation mode for legal, regulatory, medical, or technical "
"content. When on, every AI feature uses a low sampling temperature and "
"appends the addendum below to its system prompt — terminology, article "
"numbers, units, brand names, and regulatory language are preserved verbatim "
"rather than paraphrased."
msgstr ""
"Hali kali ya uhifadhi kwa maudhui ya kisheria, kanuni, matibabu, au ya "
"kiufundi. Wakati iko, kila kipengele cha AI kinatumia joto la sampuli ya "
"chini na huongeza kifungu cha chini kwa amri ya mfumo — istilahi, nambari za "
"makala, vitengo, majina ya chapa, na lugha za kanuni huhifadhiwa verbatim "
"badala ya kufupishwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:91
msgid "Global AI preset"
msgstr "Preset ya AI Ulimwenguni"

#. translators: %s: sampling temperature value, e.g. 0.2
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:106
#, php-format
msgid "T=%s"
msgstr "T=%s"

#. translators: temperature range shown for the Standard preset, e.g. "T=0.2–0.6, per feature"
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:111
msgid "T=0.2–0.6, per feature"
msgstr "T=0.2–0.6, kwa kila kipengele"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:118
msgid ""
"Sets the default AI behaviour for all features site-wide. Individual posts "
"can override this for Translation and Content Generation via the Lingua "
"Forge meta box."
msgstr ""
"Huweka tabia chaguo-msingi ya AI kwa vipengele vyote vya tovuti. Chapisho "
"binafsi kinaweza kubadilisha hii kwa Tafsiri na Uundaji wa Maudhui kupitia "
"sanduku la meta la Lingua Forge."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:119
msgid ""
"Standard uses each feature's own tuned temperature: Translation T=0.2 "
"(precise), Quick Translate T=0.4, Content Generator T=0.6 (creative). The "
"other presets apply a single fixed temperature across all features."
msgstr ""
"Kawaida hutumia joto la kila kipengele kilichopimwa: Tafsiri T=0.2 (sahihi), "
"Tafsiri Haraka T=0.4, Mwandishi wa Maudhui T=0.6 (ubunifu). Preset nyingine "
"hutumia joto moja lililowekwa kwa vipengele vyote."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:129
msgid "Technical / Scientific instructions"
msgstr "Maagizo ya Kiufundi / Sayansi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:130
msgid "Legal / Compliance instructions"
msgstr "Maagizo ya Kisheria / Uzingatiaji"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:131
msgid "Creative / Marketing instructions"
msgstr "Maagizo ya Ubunifu / Masoko"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:154
msgid ""
"Leave blank to use the built-in default. Clearing a saved override restores "
"the default on next save."
msgstr ""
"Acha tupu ili kutumia chaguo-msingi cha kujengwa ndani. Kufuta chaguo "
"lililohifadhiwa kunarudisha chaguo-msingi wakati wa hifadhi inayofuata."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:157
msgid "View built-in default"
msgstr "Tazama chaguo-msingi cha kujengwa ndani"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:166
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:177
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:571
msgid "Translation Memory"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu ya Tafsiri"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:170
msgid ""
"Cache translated equivalents at the block level so reusable content (shared "
"footers, sidebars, accordions, boilerplate-heavy legal sections) does not "
"pay an API call every time. When enabled, the translation flow parses each "
"post into blocks, looks each block up in the cache, and sends only uncached "
"blocks to the AI in a single batched request. Glossary edits and Compliance "
"preset changes automatically invalidate affected cached translations. View "
"statistics and clear the cache under Maintenance."
msgstr ""
"Hifadhi sawa za tafsiri kwenye kiwango cha block ili maudhui yanayoweza "
"kutumika tena (viambatanisho vya chini, upendeleo wa upande, accordions, "
"sehemu za kisheria zenye boilerplate nyingi) zisitoe wito wa API kila wakati."
" Wakati imewezeshwa, mchakato wa tafsiri huparsing kila chapisho kuwa blocks,"
" huangalia kila block kwenye hifadhi, na hupeleka blocks zisizo na hifadhi "
"pekee kwa AI kwa ombi moja la kundi. Mabadiliko ya kamusi na mabadiliko ya "
"preset ya Uzingatiaji huondoa hifadhi za tafsiri zinazohusika kiotomatiki. "
"Tazama takwimu na safisha hifadhi chini ya Matengenezo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:187
msgid "Enable block-level translation cache reuse across posts"
msgstr "Wezesha upyaji wa hifadhi ya tafsiri kwenye block kwa posts"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/BehaviorTab.php:190
msgid ""
"Currently skipped for posts that use block-comment attribute placeholders "
"(wp:details summary fields, etc.) — they fall through to the existing single-"
"call translation path."
msgstr ""
"Kwa sasa inakosewa kwa posts zinazotumia vigezo vya placeholder vya block-"
"comment (wp:details fields za muhtasari, n.k.) — zinapita kwa njia ya "
"tafsiri ya wito mmoja iliyopo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:22
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:548
msgid "General"
msgstr "Jumla"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:37
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:67
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Nuru"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:38
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:68
msgid "Meta Description, Excerpt Generator"
msgstr "Maelezo ya Meta, Mwandishi wa Muhtasari"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:41
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:71
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "Ubora"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:42
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:72
msgid "Translation, Content Generator"
msgstr "Tafsiri, Mwandishi wa Maudhui"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:58
msgid "Active Provider"
msgstr "Mtoa huduma wa Sasa"

#. translators: %s is the PHP constant name LINGUAFORGE_PROVIDER, wrapped in <code> tags.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:87
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Currently inherited from the %s constant. Selecting a value here will "
"override it."
msgstr ""
"Kwa sasa urithi kutoka kwa kifungo cha %s. Kuchagua thamani hapa kutaleta "
"mabadiliko."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:101
msgid "Models"
msgstr "Miundo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:105
msgid ""
"Features are grouped into two tiers. Enter the exact model identifier for "
"each tier and provider. Leave a field blank to use the built-in default "
"(shown as placeholder). Only the active provider's models are called at "
"runtime — configure the others in advance if you plan to switch."
msgstr ""
"Vipengele vimegawanywa katika ngazi mbili. Ingiza kitambulisho halisi cha "
"mfano kwa kila ngazi na mtoa huduma. Acha uwanja tupu ili kutumia chaguo-"
"msingi cha ndani (kinachoonyeshwa kama nafasi ya kujaza). Mifano ya mtoa "
"huduma anayeendesha pekee ndiyo inaitwa wakati wa runtime — weka zingine "
"mapema ikiwa unakusudia kubadilisha."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:138
msgid "active"
msgstr "kinachofanya kazi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:165
msgid "overridden"
msgstr "kimezuiwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GeneralTab.php:180
msgid ""
"Tip: to reset a model to the built-in default, clear the field and save."
msgstr ""
"Tip: ili kurejesha mfano kwa chaguo-msingi cha ndani, safisha uwanja na "
"hifadhi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:27
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:60
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:553
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "Kamusi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:64
msgid ""
"User-managed terminology table per language pair. Entries are appended to "
"the translation system prompt so the AI uses preferred terms consistently — "
"critical for domain vocabulary (\"kWp\", \"PPA\", \"interconnection point\"),"
" brand names that must not translate, and standardised regulatory phrasing. "
"Both language fields are optional: leave \"Source language\" blank to apply "
"the entry regardless of which language you are translating from; leave "
"\"Target language\" blank to apply it to all target languages at once."
msgstr ""
"Jedwali la istilahi linaloswa na mtumiaji kwa kila lugha. Viingilio "
"vinaongezwa kwenye maelekezo ya mfumo wa tafsiri ili AI itumie maneno "
"yanayopendelewa kwa utaratibu — muhimu kwa msamiati wa sekta (\"kWp\", "
"\"PPA\", \"sehemu ya kuunganishwa\"), majina ya chapa ambayo hayapaswi "
"kutafsiriwa, na maneno ya kanuni za udhibiti zilizowekwa. Sehemu zote za "
"lugha ni hiari: acha \"Lugha ya Chanzo\" tupu ili kutumia kiingilio bila "
"kujali unapotafsiri kutoka kwa lugha gani; acha \"Lugha ya Malengo\" tupu "
"ili kuitekeleza kwa lugha zote za malengo kwa pamoja."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:75
msgid "Glossary entry added."
msgstr "Kuingiza kamusi ya msamiati kumetokea."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:80
msgid "Glossary entry removed."
msgstr "Kufuta kamusi ya msamiati."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:90
msgid "Could not add entry: source term and target term are required."
msgstr ""
"Haiwezi kuongezea kiingilio: neno la chanzo na neno la malengo linahitajika."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:92
msgid "Could not save the glossary entry."
msgstr "Haiwezi kuokoa kiingilio cha kamusi ya msamiati."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:104
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:228
msgid "Source language"
msgstr "Lugha ya Chanzo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:107
msgid "— Any —"
msgstr "— Yoyote —"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:116
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:242
msgid "Target language"
msgstr "Lugha ya Malengo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:119
msgid "— Any target —"
msgstr "— Malengo yote —"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:127
msgid "Filter"
msgstr "Kichujio"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:128
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Washa upya"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:137
msgid ""
"No glossary entries match the current filter. Clear the filter to see all "
"entries, or add a new entry below."
msgstr ""
"Hakuna viingilio vya kamusi vinavyolingana na kichujio cha sasa. Futa "
"kichujio ili kuona viingilio vyote, au ongeza kiingilio kipya chini."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:139
msgid ""
"No glossary entries yet. Add one below to start enforcing terminology in "
"translations."
msgstr ""
"Hakuna viingilio vya kamusi bado. Weka chini ili kuanza kutekeleza istilahi "
"katika tafsiri."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:148
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:210
msgid "Source term"
msgstr "Neno la Chanzo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:149
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:219
msgid "Target term"
msgstr "Neno la Malengo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:150
msgid "Source lang"
msgstr "Lugha ya Chanzo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:151
msgid "Target lang"
msgstr "Lugha ya Malengo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:152
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:256
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Maelezo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:164
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:173
msgid "any"
msgstr "yote"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:188
msgid "Delete this glossary entry?"
msgstr "Unataka kufuta kiingilio hiki cha kamusi? "

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:190
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:190
msgid "Delete"
msgstr "Futa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:201
msgid "Add new entry"
msgstr "Ongeza kiingilio kipya"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:214
msgid "The phrase as it appears in the source text."
msgstr "Sehemu kama ilivyoonekana katika maandishi ya chanzo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:223
msgid ""
"How it should appear in the translation. Type the same value as the source "
"term to instruct the AI to preserve it verbatim."
msgstr ""
"Jinsi inapaswa kuonekana katika tafsiri. Andika thamani ile ile na neno la "
"chanzo ili kuagiza AI kuilinda kwa maneno halisi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:232
msgid "— Any source language —"
msgstr "— Yoyote ya lugha ya chanzo —"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:237
msgid ""
"Leave blank for brand names and language-agnostic terms that should be "
"enforced regardless of which language we are translating from."
msgstr ""
"Acha tupu kwa majina ya chapa na maneno yasiyotegemea lugha ambayo yanapaswa "
"kutekelezwa bila kujali lugha tunayotafsiri kutoka."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:246
msgid "— Any target language —"
msgstr "— Yoyote ya lugha ya malengo —"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:251
msgid ""
"Leave blank to apply this entry to all target languages — ideal for brand "
"names, abbreviations, and terms that must be preserved verbatim in every "
"translation."
msgstr ""
"Acha tupu ili kiingilio hiki kiweze kutumika kwa lugha zote za malengo — "
"bora kwa majina ya chapa, kifupi, na maneno yanayopaswa kuhifadhiwa kwa "
"maneno halisi katika kila tafsiri."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:260
msgid ""
"Optional context for editors (e.g. \"ASIC = Application-Specific Integrated "
"Circuit; preserve in English in technical contexts\")."
msgstr ""
"Muktadha wa hiari kwa wahariri (kama vile \"ASIC = Circuit ya Maombi "
"Mahususi; ihifadhi kwa Kiingereza katika muktadha wa kiufundi\")."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/GlossaryTab.php:265
msgid "Add entry"
msgstr "Ongeza kiingilio"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:22
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:550
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Mipaka"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:39
msgid "Authors and above (edit_published_posts)"
msgstr "Waandishi na zaidi (hariri_maandishi_yaliyochapwa)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:40
msgid "Contributors and above — default (edit_posts)"
msgstr "Wachangia na zaidi — chaguo-msingi (hariri_maandishi)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:41
msgid "Editors and above (edit_others_posts)"
msgstr "Wahariri na zaidi (hariri_wa_waandishi_wengine)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:42
msgid "Administrators only (manage_options)"
msgstr "Wasimamizi pekee (simamia_mipangilio)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:52
msgid "AI Limits & Security"
msgstr "Mipaka na Usalama wa AI"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:56
msgid ""
"Cap how much AI usage the site can generate and restrict which user roles "
"may trigger paid AI calls. Sits on top of the per-user rate limit (30 "
"requests / minute, hardcoded) that already protects against single-user "
"runaway loops."
msgstr ""
"Kataza kiasi cha matumizi ya AI kinachoweza kuzalishwa na tovuti na kuzuia "
"majukumu ya watumiaji wanaoweza kuanzisha simu za AI zilipwa. Inachukua "
"nafasi ya kikomo cha kila mtumiaji (ombi 30 / dakika, kilichowekwa kwa nguvu)"
" kinacholinda dhidi ya mizunguko ya kipekee ya mtumiaji."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:65
msgid "Daily request limit"
msgstr "Kikomo cha maombi ya kila siku"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:80
msgid ""
"Site-wide ceiling on AI requests per UTC day (counts both Toolbar "
"translations and block revisions). Counter resets at UTC midnight. Set to 0 "
"to disable the cap."
msgstr ""
"Kikomo cha tovuti kwa maombi ya AI kwa siku ya UTC (kinahesabu tafsiri za "
"Zana na marekebisho ya kizuizi). Kiwango kinarejeshwa saa sita usiku wa UTC. "
"Weka 0 ili kuzima kikomo."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:89
msgid "Minimum role"
msgstr "Hali ya chini"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:109
msgid ""
"Lowest WordPress capability allowed to trigger AI features. Tightening this "
"on multi-author sites prevents Contributors or trial accounts from running "
"paid AI calls. Override per-feature via the linguaforge_required_capability "
"filter."
msgstr ""
"Uwezo wa WordPress wa chini kabisa unaoruhusiwa kuanzisha vipengele vya AI. "
"Kuimarisha hili kwenye tovuti za waandishi wengi kunazuia Wachangia au "
"akaunti za majaribio kuendesha simu za AI zilipwa. Pitia kwa kila kipengele "
"kupitia kichujio cha \"linguaforge_required_capability\"."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:118
msgid "Translation Limits"
msgstr "Mipaka ya Tafsiri"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:122
msgid ""
"Control how much content is sent to the AI and how large the response can be."
" Leave a field blank to use the built-in default (shown as placeholder). "
"Raise these values if large pages are being cut off; lower them to reduce "
"API costs."
msgstr ""
"Dhibiti kiasi cha maudhui yanayopitishwa kwa AI na ukubwa wa majibu "
"yanayoweza kutolewa. Acha uwanja tupu ili kutumia chaguo-msingi cha ndani "
"(kinachoonyeshwa kama mahali pa kuweka). Ongeza thamani hizi ikiwa kurasa "
"kubwa zinakatwa; punguza ili kupunguza gharama za API."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:131
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:225
msgid "Model tier"
msgstr "Kiwango cha mfano"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:143
msgid "Quality (default — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"
msgstr "Ubora (chaguo-msingi — Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:146
msgid "Light (fast and cost-effective — Haiku / Flash)"
msgstr "Mwanga (haraka na nafuu — Haiku / Flash)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:151
msgid ""
"Which model tier to use for full-page translation. Quality uses the model "
"configured in the Models table above and is recommended for accurate, long-"
"form translation. Switch to Light only if speed or cost is the priority and "
"the content is short."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango cha mfano kinachotumika kwa tafsiri ya kurasa kamili. Ubora unatumia "
"mfano uliowekwa kwenye jedwali la Miundo hapo juu na ni wa kupendekezwa kwa "
"tafsiri sahihi, ya muda mrefu. Badilisha kwa Mwanga ikiwa ni haraka au "
"gharama ndogo ndogo ndizo kipaumbele na maudhui ni mafupi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:160
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:254
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:315
msgid "Max output tokens"
msgstr "Idadi ya tokeni za matokeo makubwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:177
msgid ""
"Maximum number of tokens the AI may produce in a single translation response."
" If a translation is silently cut off at the end, increase this value. "
"Default: 16 000."
msgstr ""
"Idadi kubwa ya tokeni ambazo AI inaweza kuzalisha kwa jibu moja la tafsiri. "
"Ikiwa tafsiri inakatwa kimya kimya mwisho, ongeza thamani hii. Chaguo-msingi:"
" 16,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:186
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:278
msgid "Max input characters"
msgstr "Herufi za ingizo za juu zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:203
msgid ""
"Maximum number of characters of post content forwarded to the AI. 0 means no "
"limit — the full content is always sent (recommended). Set a non-zero value "
"only if your provider has a tight context window. A warning is written to "
"the PHP error log whenever the content is trimmed."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango kikubwa cha wahusika wa maudhui ya chapisho yaliyotumwa kwa AI. 0 "
"inamaanisha hakuna kikomo — maudhui kamili yanatumiwa daima (inapendekezwa). "
"Weka thamani isiyo sifuri ikiwa mtoa huduma wako ana dirisha la muktadha "
"mkali. Onyo linaandikwa kwenye kumbukumbu ya makosa ya PHP kila wakati "
"maudhui yanapunguzwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:212
msgid "Quick Translation"
msgstr "Tafsiri Haraka"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:216
msgid ""
"Quick Translation is used for snippet/chunk mode — short passages translated "
"on demand from the toolbar, editor, or block popovers. It uses a separate, "
"lighter configuration from the full-page translation to keep responses fast "
"and cost-effective."
msgstr ""
"Tafsiri Haraka hutumiwa kwa hali ya vipande/vipande — vifungu vifupi "
"vinavyotafsiriwa kwa ombi kutoka kwa upau wa zana, mhariri, au popo za "
"kizuizi. Inatumia usanidi tofauti, nyepesi kutoka kwa tafsiri ya ukurasa "
"kamili ili kuweka majibu kuwa ya haraka na yenye gharama nafuu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:237
msgid "Light (default — fast and cost-effective)"
msgstr "Nuru (chaguo-msingi — haraka na yenye gharama nafuu)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:240
msgid "Quality (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"
msgstr "Ubora (Sonnet / GPT-4o / Gemini Pro)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:245
msgid ""
"The Light tier uses the fast model configured in the Models table above "
"(default: Haiku / Flash). Switch to Quality if you need the same translation "
"accuracy as full-page mode for snippets."
msgstr ""
"Kiwango cha Nuru kinatumia mfano wa haraka uliowekwa kwenye jedwali la "
"Miundo hapo juu (chaguo-msingi: Haiku / Flash). Badilisha kwa Ubora ikiwa "
"unahitaji usahihi wa tafsiri sawa na hali ya ukurasa kamili kwa vipande."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:270
msgid ""
"Maximum tokens the AI may produce per quick translation. Default: 2 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaowezekana na AI inaweza kuzalisha kwa kila tafsiri "
"ya haraka. Chagua: 2,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:294
msgid "Maximum characters accepted from the input field. Default: 8 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaokubaliwa kutoka kwa uwanja wa ingizo. Chaguo-"
"msingi: 8,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:302
msgid "Content Generator"
msgstr "Kizazi cha Maudhui"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:306
msgid ""
"Controls the token budget and input limits for the AI Content Generator "
"feature. Leave fields blank to use the built-in defaults."
msgstr ""
"Hudhibiti bajeti ya tokeni na mipaka ya ingizo kwa kipengele cha Kizazi cha "
"Maudhui cha AI. Acha mashamba tupu ili kutumia chaguo-msingi zilizojengwa "
"ndani."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:331
msgid ""
"Maximum tokens the AI may produce per generation run. Raise this if full "
"articles are being cut off. Default: 8 192."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaowezekana na AI wanaweza kuzalisha kwa kila "
"uendeshaji wa kizazi. Ongeza ikiwa makala kamili yanakatwa. Chaguo-msingi: 8,"
"192."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:339
msgid "Max hints characters"
msgstr "Wahusika wa vidokezo vya juu zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:355
msgid "Maximum characters read from the Hints field. Default: 2 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wanaosomwa kutoka kwa uwanja wa Vidokezo. Chaguo-"
"msingi: 2,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:363
msgid "Max context characters"
msgstr "Wahusika wa muktadha wa juu zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/LimitsTab.php:379
msgid ""
"Maximum characters of existing post content passed to the AI as seed context "
"when no Hints are provided. Default: 6 000."
msgstr ""
"Wahusika wa juu zaidi wa maudhui ya chapisho yaliyopo yanayotumwa kwa AI "
"kama muktadha wa mbegu wakati hakuna Vidokezo vinavyotolewa. Chaguo-msingi: "
"6,000."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:28
#: ai/includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:555
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "Matengenezo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:100
msgid "Language Overrides"
msgstr "Mabadiliko ya Lugha"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:104
msgid ""
"Upload compiled .mo files to override third-party plugin strings for "
"specific locales — for example, a custom VikBooking translation that uses "
"\"apartment\" instead of \"room\". Files must follow the WordPress naming "
"convention: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (e.g. vikbooking-ca.mo). They are "
"stored in the uploads folder and survive plugin updates."
msgstr ""
"Pakua faili zilizokusanywa za .mo kubadilisha maneno ya programu za watu "
"wengine kwa maeneo maalum — kwa mfano, tafsiri maalum ya VikBooking "
"inayotumia \"apartment\" badala ya \"room\". Faili lazima zifuate muundo wa "
"jina la WordPress: {textdomain}-{locale}.mo (mfano, vikbooking-ca.mo). Zina "
"hifadhiwa kwenye folda ya uploads na huishi baada ya sasisho la programu."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:113
msgid "Override file uploaded successfully."
msgstr "Faili ya mabadiliko imepakuliwa kwa mafanikio."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:118
msgid "Override file deleted."
msgstr "Faili ya mabadiliko imefutwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:123
msgid "No file was selected."
msgstr "Hakuna faili iliyochaguliwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:124
msgid "Only .mo files are accepted."
msgstr "Faili za .mo pekee zinakubaliwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:125
msgid "The upload failed — please try again."
msgstr "Upakuaji umeshindwa — tafadhali jaribu tena."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:126
msgid "Could not save the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable."
msgstr ""
"Haiwezekani kuhifadhi faili. Hakikisha folda ya uploads ina haki ya kuandika."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:127
msgid "Invalid filename."
msgstr "Jina la faili si sahihi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:128
msgid "Security check failed — file path is not permitted."
msgstr "Uhakiki wa usalama umeshindwa — njia ya faili haikubaliki."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:131
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:273
msgid "An unknown error occurred."
msgstr "Hitilafu isiyojulikana imetokea."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:159
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:285
msgid "Text domain / locale"
msgstr "Uwanja wa lugha / muktadha"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:160
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:287
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:533
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Faili"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:161
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:288
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Ukubwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:184
msgid "Delete all files for this override (both .mo and .po)?"
msgstr "Futa faili zote za mabadiliko haya (zote .mo na .po)?"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:202
msgid "No override files uploaded yet."
msgstr "Hakuna faili za mabadiliko zilizopakiwa bado."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:220
msgid "Upload .mo file"
msgstr "Pakua faili ya .mo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:232
msgid ""
"Accepts compiled .mo files only. Filename must follow the pattern "
"{textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Uploading a file with the same name as an existing "
"one will replace it."
msgstr ""
"Inakubali faili zilizokusanywa za .mo pekee. Jina la faili lazima zifuate "
"muundo wa {textdomain}-{locale}.mo. Kupakia faili lenye jina sawa na la "
"zamani kutalibadilisha."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:239
msgid "Upload Override"
msgstr "Pakua Mabadiliko"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:248
msgid "Loco Translate — Copy to Safe Storage"
msgstr "Loco Tafsiri — Nakili kwa Hifadhi Salama"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:252
msgid ""
"Loco Translate stores its custom translations in wp-content/languages/loco/ "
"— a location that can be silently wiped by a WP core update, plugin "
"reinstall, or if Loco Translate itself is removed. Copying files here moves "
"them into the Lingua Forge i18n-overrides directory, which persists through "
"all of those events and is loaded automatically on every request."
msgstr ""
"Loco Translate hifadhi tafsiri zake maalum katika wp-content/languages/loco/ "
"— mahali ambapo inaweza kufutwa kwa kimya na sasisho la WP, kufanywa upya "
"kwa programu, au ikiwa Loco Translate yenyewe inatoweka. Nakili faili hapa "
"huziweka kwenye saraka ya Lingua Forge i18n-overrides, ambayo huendelea kuwa "
"hai kupitia matukio yote hayo na hujumuishwa kiotomatiki kila wakati."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:263
msgid "File copied to safe storage successfully."
msgstr "Faili imehamishwa kwa mafanikio kwenye hifadhi salama."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:268
msgid "Source file not found."
msgstr "Faili ya chanzo haipatikani."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:269
msgid "Could not copy the file. Check that the uploads folder is writable."
msgstr ""
"Haiwezekani kunakili faili. Hakikisha folda ya uploads ina haki ya kuandika."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:270
msgid "Invalid file reference."
msgstr "Rejea ya faili si sahihi."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:286
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Aina"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:307
msgid "✓ In safe storage"
msgstr "✓ Katika hifadhi salama"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:320
msgid "Copy to safe storage"
msgstr "Nakili kwenye hifadhi salama"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:333
msgid ""
"No custom Loco Translate files found yet. They appear here once you save a "
"translation in Loco Translate."
msgstr ""
"Hakuna faili maalum za Loco Translate bado. Zinaonekana hapa mara tu "
"unapohifadhi tafsiri kwenye Loco Translate."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:343
msgid "AI Cache"
msgstr "Cache ya AI"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:347
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge caches AI-generated translations, meta descriptions, excerpts, "
"and generated content per-post so unchanged inputs do not re-trigger a paid "
"API call. Cached entries are automatically invalidated when their inputs "
"change. Clear the cache manually to reclaim database space, force a resync "
"after switching providers or editing prompt templates, or troubleshoot a "
"cache-related issue."
msgstr ""
"Lingua Forge huhifadhi tafsiri zinazozalishwa na AI, maelezo ya meta, "
"vipande, na maudhui yaliyotengenezwa kwa kila chapisho ili maneno "
"yasiyobadilika yasirejeshe wito wa API uliolipwa. Vipengee vilivyohifadhiwa "
"kiotomatiki vinavunjwa wakati waingizo yao hubadilika. Futa cache kwa mikono "
"ili kurejesha nafasi ya hifadhidata, kulazimisha upya baada ya kubadilisha "
"watoa huduma au kuhariri templates za maombi, au kutatua tatizo la cache."

#. translators: %d is the number of cleared cache entries.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:365
#, php-format
msgid "AI cache cleared. %d entry was removed."
msgid_plural "AI cache cleared. %d entries were removed."
msgstr[0] "Cache ya AI imefutwa. Kipengee %d kiliondolewa."
msgstr[1] "Cache ya AI imefutwa. Vipengee %d vimeondolewa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:381
msgid ""
"Clear all cached AI results? Future requests will trigger fresh API calls "
"until the cache rebuilds."
msgstr ""
"Futa matokeo yote ya AI yaliyohifadhiwa? Maombi yajayo yataanzisha wito mpya "
"wa API hadi cache itakapojengwa upya."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:387
msgid "Clear AI Cache"
msgstr "Futa Kumbukumbu za AI"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:397
msgid "Debug Files"
msgstr "Faili za Kagua"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:401
msgid ""
"When debug logging is enabled (via the toggle below or by defining "
"LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG in wp-config.php), the Translation and FSE template "
"translation features write their raw AI prompts and responses to disk for "
"troubleshooting. Use this section to monitor that output and clear it once "
"you have what you need — the files can grow quickly on large pages. "
"Configure the destination directory via the linguaforge_debug_dir filter."
msgstr ""
"Wakati kumbukumbu za kagua zinapokua zimewezeshwa (kupitia kitufe cha chini "
"au kwa kufafanua LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG katika wp-config.php), vipengele vya "
"Tafsiri na template ya FSE huandika maombi yao ya AI na majibu kwenye diski "
"kwa ajili ya utatuzi wa matatizo. Tumia sehemu hii kufuatilia matokeo hayo "
"na kuyaondoa mara umepata unachohitaji — faili zinaweza kukua kwa haraka "
"kwenye kurasa kubwa. Sanidi saraka ya malengo kupitia kichungi cha "
"linguaforge_debug_dir."

#. translators: %d is the number of removed debug files.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "Debug files cleared. %d file was removed."
msgid_plural "Debug files cleared. %d files were removed."
msgstr[0] "Faili za kagua zimesafishwa. Faili %d imeondolewa."
msgstr[1] "Faili za kagua zimesafishwa. Faili %d zimeondolewa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:449
msgid "Debug logging enabled."
msgstr "Kumbukumbu za kagua zimewezeshwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:451
msgid "Debug logging disabled."
msgstr "Kumbukumbu za kagua zimezimwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:467
msgid "Debug logging"
msgstr "Kumbukumbu za kagua"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:478
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:499
msgid "Write AI prompts and responses to disk for troubleshooting"
msgstr ""
"Andika maombi ya AI na majibu kwenye diski kwa ajili ya utatuzi wa matatizo"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:483
msgid ""
"Forced ON by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove that "
"line to control this toggle from here."
msgstr ""
"Imezuiwa kwa nguvu na mabadiliko ya LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG katika wp-config."
"php. Ondoa mstari huo ili kudhibiti kitufe hiki kutoka hapa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:485
msgid ""
"Forced OFF by the LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG constant in wp-config.php. Remove "
"that line to control this toggle from here."
msgstr ""
"Imezimwa kwa nguvu na mabadiliko ya LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG katika wp-config."
"php. Ondoa mstari huo ili kudhibiti kitufe hiki kutoka hapa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:503
msgid ""
"Files land in the directory below. Useful for diagnosing translation issues "
"— turn off once you have what you need so the files do not accumulate. You "
"can also force this from wp-config.php with `define( 'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG', "
"true );` which overrides the toggle."
msgstr ""
"Faili huwasili kwenye saraka iliyo chini. Inafaa kwa utatuzi wa matatizo ya "
"tafsiri — zima mara unapata unachohitaji ili faili zisikusanyike. Pia "
"unaweza kuizuia kutoka wp-config.php kwa kutumia `define( "
"'LINGUAFORGE_AI_DEBUG', true );` ambayo inazidi kitufe hiki."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:510
msgid "Currently:"
msgstr "Sasa hivi:"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:513
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:617
msgid "✓ Enabled"
msgstr "✓ Imewashwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:517
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:621
msgid "✗ Disabled"
msgstr "✗ Imesimamishwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:524
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "Saraka"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:528
msgid ""
"Filter with linguaforge_debug_dir to redirect debug output to a non-public "
"location."
msgstr ""
"Chuja kwa kutumia linguaforge_debug_dir ili kuelekeza matokeo ya kagua "
"mahali pasipo umma."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:536
msgid ".txt file(s) in the directory"
msgstr ".txt faili(za) kwenye saraka"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:543
msgid "Save Debug Setting"
msgstr "Hifadhi Mipangilio ya Kagua"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:554
msgid ""
"Delete all .txt files in the debug directory? The directory itself will "
"remain so future debug writes still land cleanly."
msgstr ""
"Futa faili zote za .txt kwenye saraka ya kagua? Saraka yenyewe itabaki ili "
"kuendelea kuandika mafaili ya kagua ya baadaye."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:560
msgid "Clear Debug Files"
msgstr "Futa Faili za Kagua"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:575
msgid ""
"Per-block translation cache shared across posts. Configure on/off in "
"Settings → Behavior. Stats below show what is currently cached; clearing "
"forces every block to be re-translated on next request (useful after "
"upgrading models or to recover database space)."
msgstr ""
"Kuhifadhi cache ya tafsiri kwa kila kipande kinachoshirikiwa kati ya "
"machapisho. Sanidi on/off katika Vipimo → Tabia. Takwimu chini zinaonyesha "
"kile kinachohifadhiwa kwa sasa; kufuta kunalazimisha kila kipande "
"kutafsiriwa tena kwenye ombi lijalo (inafaa baada ya kusasisha mifano au "
"kurejesha nafasi ya hifadhi ya data)."

#. translators: %d is the number of removed cached blocks.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:593
#, php-format
msgid "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached block was removed."
msgid_plural "Translation Memory cleared. %d cached blocks were removed."
msgstr[0] "Kumbukumbu ya Tafsiri imefutwa. Kipande cha cache %d kiliondolewa."
msgstr[1] "Kumbukumbu ya Tafsiri imefutwa. Vipande %d vya cache vimeondolewa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:613
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Hali"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:623
msgid "— toggle in Settings → Behavior."
msgstr "— chaguo katika Vipimo → Tabia."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:628
msgid "Cached blocks"
msgstr "Vipande vilivyohifadhiwa"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:634
msgid "Cumulative cache hits"
msgstr "Mafanikio ya cache ya jumla"

#. translators: %s is the average hits per cached block.
#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:642
#, php-format
msgid "(avg %.1f hits/block)"
msgstr "(avg %.1f mafanikio/kipande)"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:651
msgid "Oldest entry"
msgstr "Kipindi cha zamani zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:655
msgid "Newest entry"
msgstr "Kipindi kipya zaidi"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:660
msgid "Approximate size"
msgstr "Ukubwa wa takriban"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:672
msgid ""
"Clear the entire Translation Memory? Future translations will rebuild the "
"cache as they run."
msgstr ""
"Futa Kumbukumbu ya Tafsiri yote? Tafsiri za baadaye zitajenga tena cache "
"wanapozalishwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:678
msgid "Clear Translation Memory"
msgstr "Futa Kumbukumbu ya Tafsiri"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:689
msgid "Uninstall Behaviour"
msgstr "Futa Tabia ya Kifuta"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:693
msgid ""
"Controls what happens when an administrator deletes the plugin from Plugins "
"→ Installed Plugins → Delete. Plugin settings and AI caches are always "
"removed. Language assignments and translation relationships are kept by "
"default so an accidental uninstall or a reinstall can pick up where it left "
"off."
msgstr ""
"Hakikisha kinachotokea wakati msimamizi anafuta programu kutoka kwa Plugins "
"→ Plugins zilizowekwa → Futa. Mipangilio ya programu na cache za AI daima "
"zinasafishwa. Uteuzi wa lugha na uhusiano wa tafsiri huzingatiwa kwa chaguo-"
"msingi ili kusudi la kufuta au kufunga upya liweze kuendelea mahali pa "
"kuacha."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:704
msgid "Uninstall setting saved."
msgstr "Mipangilio ya kufuta imesimamiwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:717
msgid "Delete content data on uninstall"
msgstr "Futa data ya maudhui wakati wa kufuta"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:726
msgid ""
"Also delete language assignments, translation relationships, meta "
"descriptions, glossary, and Translation Memory when the plugin is uninstalled"
msgstr ""
"Pia futa uteuzi wa lugha, uhusiano wa tafsiri, maelezo ya meta, kamusi, na "
"Kumbukumbu ya Tafsiri wakati programu inafutwa."

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:729
msgid "Warning:"
msgstr "Onyo:"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Tabs/MaintenanceTab.php:731
msgid ""
"If checked, uninstalling the plugin will permanently delete all language "
"assignments, translation relationships, meta descriptions, per-page presets, "
"the AI glossary, and Translation Memory for every post on this site. This "
"cannot be undone. Leave unchecked unless you are fully removing multilingual "
"support from the site."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa imeshakaguliwa, kufuta programu kutafuta kwa muda mrefu utafuta uteuzi "
"wa lugha, uhusiano wa tafsiri, maelezo ya meta, mipangilio ya ukurasa, "
"kamusi ya AI, na Kumbukumbu ya Tafsiri kwa kila chapisho kwenye tovuti hii. "
"Hii haiwezi kurejeshwa. Acha ishiwi isipokuwa unatoa msaada wa lugha nyingi "
"kutoka kwa tovuti."

